OL,4,BMatos accepts Swansea fans' anger over 
OL,5,Bshock exit                             
OL,6,GVitor Matos admits he knows why        
OL,7,GSwansea City fans will be angry        
OL,8,Gfollowing his sudden departure from    
OL,9,Gthe club.                              
OL,11,FThe Portuguese head coach quit the     
OL,12,FChampionship side this week for the    
OL,13,Ftop job at French Ligue 1 club RC      
OL,14,FStrasbourg.                            
OL,16,FHis move took Swansea by complete      
OL,17,Fsurprise, just a week before marking   
OL,18,Fhis first year in charge with the club 
OL,19,Fsixth in the table and having signed a 
OL,20,Fnew contract until 2030 in July.       
